{"id":1658,"skill":"listening","title":"[C3T1] - Flagstone propeties","type":2,"quizType":3,"durationMin":60,"thumbnail":"0ed3d7d8-ee0b-4f92-9c38-518b2c357eb7","thumbnailUrl":"/assets/thumbs-listening/1658.jpg","totalSubmitted":1202,"voteCount":3,"isPublic":true,"quizCode":"","dateUpdated":"2026-05-08T12:08:01.624539+07:00","tags":[{"id":35,"code":"section_1","title":"Section 1"},{"id":6,"code":"FILL_BLANK","title":"Gap Filling"}],"parts":[{"id":1734,"index":1,"title":"","transcriptHtml":"<h2>Flagstone property</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #000000;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Hello ... Flagstone.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Oh hello; is that Flagstone Properties?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE</strong>:</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Yes, that's right. Flagstone here. How can I help you?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Hello. I&rsquo;m ringing just to make enquiries about renting a house. My name&rsquo;s Jon Anderson.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Yes, Mr Anderson. What sort of thing were you looking for?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Two-bedroomed house with garden.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE</strong>:</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>{[Well. .. yes, sir, that shouldn&rsquo;t be any problem ... just to let you know that our main areas, the main areas we deal with, are the city centre itself...][1]}</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>City center ... uh-huh.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>And the north suburbs.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Oh well... we were most interested in the Northern areas actually.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Right... yes... What sort of price were you thinking of?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Well... could you give me some ideas?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Certainly. {[It really ranges from &pound;250 per month.][2]}</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Only &pound;250?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>{[Yes, to about &pound;500 depending on a number of different factors.][3]}</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>What does it depend on?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Well, obviously the quality of the area. And then whether there&rsquo;s a garden.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Well, as I said, we&rsquo;d want a garden.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE</strong>:</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>And a garage pushes up the price.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Right... Well, we wouldn&rsquo;t necessarily need one. I think about &pound;350 a month would be our limit.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>OK. Well... would you like to have a look at a couple of properties, sir?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Yes, that&rsquo;d be great.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Looking at our files ... I think we&rsquo;ve got two which might suit you ...</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Hang on. I&rsquo;ll just get a pen. Right.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>{[OK. Well, there&rsquo;s one on West Park Road which is &pound;325 a month.][4]}</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Are the bills included?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>{[Well, that one just includes the water bill.][5]}</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>OK, right.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>{[And the second house is on Tithe Road.][6]} I&rsquo;ll just spell that for you ... OK?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>T-I-T-H-E Road.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Got that. And how much is that one?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>{[That&rsquo;s &pound;380.][6]}</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE</strong>:</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>380. Is that including water?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>{[No, I&rsquo;m afraid not, but it does include the telephone rental.][6]}</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Oh well, that&rsquo;s not too bad then. So, ...</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>So, when would you be available to see them?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Well, I&rsquo;ll be in town next week... say... Thursday?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>No, I&rsquo;m sorry we don&rsquo;t have any availability for Thursday. {[How about Wednesday afternoon?][7]}</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>{[OK. That&rsquo;s fine. Would 5.00 be OK?][7]}</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Yes, fine. 5.00 it is. Just come to the Flagstone Offices.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Oh, before I forget. What sort of things do I need to get done... to rent with you?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Well, the most important thing is a letter from your bank...</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>No problem...</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>{[And then a reference letter from your employer.][8]}</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Yes, that&rsquo;s OK.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE</strong>:</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>{[Great, and then we would need you to give 2 weeks&rsquo; notice of moving in...][9]}</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>{[Right... 2 weeks&rsquo; notice. And what about a deposit?][10]}</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>{[That&rsquo;s one month&rsquo;s rent, whatever the amount is.][10]}</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>OK. One month. Is that it?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>No, sorry, one more... you will have to pay for the contract.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Oh yes. I&rsquo;d forgotten about that. OK, fine. So I&rsquo;ll start arranging those, and I&rsquo;ll...</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>... I&rsquo;ll see you next week.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JON:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Yes. Thanks very much. Bye.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p><strong>JANICE:</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<p>Goodbye.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>","transcriptSegments":[{"paragraph":0,"sentences":[{"id":714848,"text":"Flagstone property","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":1,"sentences":[{"id":714852,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":2,"sentences":[{"id":714855,"text":"Hello ... Flagstone.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":3,"sentences":[{"id":714859,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":4,"sentences":[{"id":714862,"text":"Oh hello; is that Flagstone Properties?","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":5,"sentences":[{"id":714870,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":6,"sentences":[{"id":714873,"text":"Yes, that’s right.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":714877,"text":"Flagstone here.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":714880,"text":"How can I help you?","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":7,"sentences":[{"id":714887,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":8,"sentences":[{"id":714890,"text":"Hello.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":714892,"text":"I’m ringing just to make enquiries about renting a house.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":714902,"text":"My name’s Jon Anderson.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":9,"sentences":[{"id":714908,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":10,"sentences":[{"id":714911,"text":"Yes, Mr Anderson.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":714915,"text":"What sort of thing were you looking for?","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":11,"sentences":[{"id":714925,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":12,"sentences":[{"id":714928,"text":"Two-bedroomed house with garden.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":13,"sentences":[{"id":714935,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":14,"sentences":[{"id":714938,"text":"Well.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":714940,"text":".. yes, sir, that shouldn’t be any problem ... just to let you know that our main areas, the main areas we deal with, are the city centre itself...","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":15,"sentences":[{"id":714969,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":16,"sentences":[{"id":714972,"text":"City center ... uh-huh.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":17,"sentences":[{"id":714977,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":18,"sentences":[{"id":714980,"text":"And the north suburbs.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":19,"sentences":[{"id":714986,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":20,"sentences":[{"id":714989,"text":"Oh well... we were most interested in the Northern areas actually.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":21,"sentences":[{"id":715002,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":22,"sentences":[{"id":715005,"text":"Right... yes... What sort of price were you thinking of?","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":23,"sentences":[{"id":715017,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":24,"sentences":[{"id":715020,"text":"Well... could you give me some ideas?","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":25,"sentences":[{"id":715029,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":26,"sentences":[{"id":715032,"text":"Certainly.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":715034,"text":"It really ranges from £250 per month.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":27,"sentences":[{"id":715043,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":28,"sentences":[{"id":715046,"text":"Only £250?","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":29,"sentences":[{"id":715050,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":30,"sentences":[{"id":715053,"text":"Yes, to about £500 depending on a number of different factors.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":31,"sentences":[{"id":715065,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":32,"sentences":[{"id":715068,"text":"What does it depend on?","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":33,"sentences":[{"id":715075,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":34,"sentences":[{"id":715078,"text":"Well, obviously the quality of the area.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":715086,"text":"And then whether there’s a garden.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":35,"sentences":[{"id":715093,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":36,"sentences":[{"id":715096,"text":"Well, as I said, we’d want a garden.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":37,"sentences":[{"id":715105,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":38,"sentences":[{"id":715108,"text":"And a garage pushes up the price.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":39,"sentences":[{"id":715116,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":40,"sentences":[{"id":715119,"text":"Right... Well, we wouldn’t necessarily need one.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":715127,"text":"I think about £350 a month would be our limit.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":41,"sentences":[{"id":715138,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":42,"sentences":[{"id":715141,"text":"OK. Well... would you like to have a look at a couple of properties, sir?","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":43,"sentences":[{"id":715156,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":44,"sentences":[{"id":715159,"text":"Yes, that’d be great.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":45,"sentences":[{"id":715165,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":46,"sentences":[{"id":715168,"text":"Looking at our files ...","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":715173,"text":"I think we’ve got two which might suit you ...","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":47,"sentences":[{"id":715185,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":48,"sentences":[{"id":715188,"text":"Hang on.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":715191,"text":"I’ll just get a pen.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":715197,"text":"Right.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":49,"sentences":[{"id":715200,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":50,"sentences":[{"id":715203,"text":"OK. Well, there’s one on West Park Road which is £325 a month.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":51,"sentences":[{"id":715217,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":52,"sentences":[{"id":715220,"text":"Are the bills included?","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":53,"sentences":[{"id":715226,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":54,"sentences":[{"id":715229,"text":"Well, that one just includes the water bill.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":55,"sentences":[{"id":715239,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":56,"sentences":[{"id":715242,"text":"OK, right.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":57,"sentences":[{"id":715246,"text":"JANICE:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":58,"sentences":[{"id":715249,"text":"And the second house is on Tithe Road.","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null},{"id":715258,"text":"I’ll just spell that for you ... OK?","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":59,"sentences":[{"id":715267,"text":"JON:","from":null,"to":null,"speaker":null}]},{"paragraph":60,"sentences":[{"id":715270,"text":"T-I-T-H-E Road."